        <mxCell id="LlxE9OzZP7TgydXDOlq4-7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;I2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(154, 199, 191);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Command and Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0px 0px 6px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; margin: 0px 0px 6px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;SOCKS proxy up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Payload executes and remote shell access is granted. Hacker sets up a SOCKS4a proxy on port 1080 to pivot vmbr1 internet traffic to the external attacker machine.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ATT&amp;amp;CK:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;T1071&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;T1090&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
